  "notes": "{重症|じゅうしょう} refers to a serious or critical medical condition.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {重症|じゅうしょう}の{患者|かんじゃ} (critically ill patient)\n- {重症|じゅうしょう}になる (to become seriously ill)\n- {重症|じゅうしょう}{者|しゃ} (person in critical condition)\n- {重症化|じゅうしょうか}する (to become severe)\n\nSEVERITY SCALE:\n- {軽症|けいしょう}: mild condition\n- {中等症|ちゅうとうしょう}: moderate condition\n- {重症|じゅうしょう}: serious condition\n- {重篤|じゅうとく}: critical condition\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {症状|しょうじょう}: symptoms\n- ⟦{容態|ようだい}→容態：09797_youdai⟧: patient's condition",
